WEBVTT

01:29.690 --> 01:35.290
Our Secret
EP09

01:42.800 --> 01:44.449
Didn't you say you wanted to study?

01:47.240 --> 01:48.449
You didn't even open your book.

01:48.449 --> 01:49.770
I was just about to open it.

01:56.920 --> 01:59.479
Mom, you can go back to rest.

01:59.800 --> 02:00.880
I will study.

02:02.370 --> 02:03.330
Take it out.

02:15.050 --> 02:16.600
Whom did you call just now?

02:18.049 --> 02:18.970
My classmate.

02:19.160 --> 02:20.130
What classmate?

02:20.130 --> 02:21.290
It's so late now.

02:22.690 --> 02:24.799
I asked him about the homework today.

02:34.440 --> 02:35.290
Mom

02:36.720 --> 02:38.490
I promise I won't

02:38.640 --> 02:40.640
chat with classmates at night.

02:41.880 --> 02:43.930
I'll keep it for you first.

02:44.130 --> 02:45.520
It's for your own good.

02:45.720 --> 02:46.970
Study hard and don't be distracted.

02:47.490 --> 02:48.850
Remember to eat the fruit.

02:58.690 --> 03:01.850
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

03:02.050 --> 03:05.440
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

03:05.640 --> 03:09.210
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

03:09.690 --> 03:13.330
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

03:13.570 --> 03:14.640
Happy birthday!

03:14.800 --> 03:15.640
Thank you.

03:16.360 --> 03:17.210
Make a birthday wish.

03:22.640 --> 03:23.520
In one blow.

03:25.130 --> 03:25.720
OK.

03:29.440 --> 03:30.440
No need to thank me.

03:30.570 --> 03:31.600
Just have fun.

03:33.360 --> 03:34.330
Enjoy yourselves.

03:34.640 --> 03:35.970
Kong Shadi, really it's you here.

03:35.970 --> 03:36.970
Haven't seen you for a long time.

03:37.799 --> 03:38.690
It's us.

03:39.720 --> 03:40.930
We were playmates in junior high.

03:41.080 --> 03:41.850
Remember?

03:43.210 --> 03:44.520
You are...

03:44.520 --> 03:45.330
That's unimportant.

03:45.570 --> 03:46.440
The point is that

03:46.440 --> 03:47.360
you're more and more beautiful.

03:48.330 --> 03:49.290
You didn't invite us both

03:49.290 --> 03:50.930
to your birthday party.

03:51.440 --> 03:52.360
What happened?

03:53.160 --> 03:55.410
I only invited my classmates this time.

03:55.410 --> 03:56.850
I'll invite you next time.

03:57.130 --> 03:57.600
Don't wait until next time.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.160
Come to join us. Let's go.

03:59.490 --> 04:00.290
No, no.

04:05.080 --> 04:06.640
Didn't you hear her say no?

04:07.640 --> 04:08.520
Who are you?

04:08.640 --> 04:10.050
It's not up to you to tell me what to do.

04:10.640 --> 04:12.050
You don't know I'm from No.18 Middle School.

04:12.050 --> 04:12.520
Right?

04:14.690 --> 04:15.930
It doesn't matter who I am.

04:16.440 --> 04:17.480
Do you know Jiang Chen?

04:17.850 --> 04:18.480
Of course.

04:19.450 --> 04:20.410
I was with him just now.

04:20.799 --> 04:21.730
He's my childhood friend.

04:22.850 --> 04:23.850
What are your names?

04:23.850 --> 04:24.760
I'll phone and ask him.

04:24.890 --> 04:25.290
Wait a moment.

04:25.290 --> 04:26.450
No no no, forget it.

04:26.520 --> 04:27.450
Don't bother Chen.

04:27.640 --> 04:28.610
It was all a big mistake, bro.

04:28.800 --> 04:29.890
Since you're the friend of Chen

04:29.920 --> 04:30.920
we won't bother you.

04:31.080 --> 04:31.360
We.

04:31.360 --> 04:31.970
We're leaving.

04:32.200 --> 04:33.040
We're just kidding.

04:33.320 --> 04:34.610
-Happy birthday.  -Happy birthday.

04:36.010 --> 04:36.850
Bye.

04:40.610 --> 04:44.010
-Ziqi, you're so cool.  -Cool.

04:44.240 --> 04:45.240
Keep a low profile.

04:45.480 --> 04:46.610
Enjoy yourselves.

04:47.010 --> 04:48.290
I'll find someone to cut the cake.

04:57.129 --> 04:57.920
Why are you looking at me?

04:58.480 --> 04:59.970
You don't have enough friends?

05:01.480 --> 05:02.890
lt is none of your business.

05:03.760 --> 05:05.610
How can you be friends with them?

05:06.290 --> 05:07.410
You don't learn from good examples.

05:07.480 --> 05:08.970
Is it not enough for you to have me?

05:19.240 --> 05:21.800
Studying hard with me is the most important.

05:22.890 --> 05:23.570
Do you hear me?

05:24.970 --> 05:25.800
Do you hear me?

05:26.170 --> 05:26.890
Yes.

05:28.200 --> 05:29.010
Let's play games.

05:29.610 --> 05:30.360
Any advice?

05:30.730 --> 05:31.800
Word chain.

05:33.730 --> 05:34.240
You're bored.

05:34.240 --> 05:35.450
-So boring.  -Listen to the birthday girl.

05:35.850 --> 05:37.010
Shadi, Shadi, what's your opinion?

05:37.010 --> 05:37.730
What do you want to play?

05:37.890 --> 05:38.690
Word chain.

05:38.690 --> 05:40.480
Look! Look!

07:07.690 --> 07:08.450
Mr. Liu

07:08.640 --> 07:10.610
How's it going? Have you figured it out?

07:11.040 --> 07:11.850
Yes.

07:12.290 --> 07:13.920
The abscissa of point P is one.

07:15.690 --> 07:16.520
You are sure to win the prize.

07:16.640 --> 07:17.920
Let me tell you about the last question.

07:17.920 --> 07:18.850
Many students...

07:20.080 --> 07:22.040
Is that what I asked you?

07:22.730 --> 07:23.760
Will you tell me

07:23.760 --> 07:25.290
where you went last night?

07:28.520 --> 07:31.890
Siyue, if you have something on your mind

07:32.640 --> 07:34.080
you can tell me.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.080
I understand you.

07:37.320 --> 07:39.240
But do not keep them bottled up.

07:39.690 --> 07:40.360
Understand?

07:42.290 --> 07:43.040
Yes.

07:44.890 --> 07:45.970
I'll tell you next time.

07:46.080 --> 07:46.690
What? You.

07:48.290 --> 07:49.010
Thank you, Mr. Liu.

07:49.010 --> 07:50.240
You little brat.

07:52.690 --> 07:53.640
Mr. Liu

07:55.200 --> 07:56.850
I know where Zhou Siyue went last night.

07:57.570 --> 07:59.170
You are everywhere.

08:00.170 --> 08:00.850
Wait.

08:01.850 --> 08:04.410
Tell me. Where did he go last night?

08:07.690 --> 08:09.040
Hello. What's up?

08:11.360 --> 08:11.970
Where is she?

08:16.640 --> 08:17.570
I'll go there first.

08:17.800 --> 08:18.800
You go to get others.

08:35.120 --> 08:35.970
Little Monster

08:36.639 --> 08:37.560
Help.

08:38.080 --> 08:39.680
Please give me your English homework.

08:39.879 --> 08:41.560
Why don't you borrow Childe Zhou's?

08:41.850 --> 08:43.440
He has just finished the competition and is sleeping.

08:43.440 --> 08:44.560
How dare I wake him up?

08:46.880 --> 08:48.850
So I have to settle for second best

08:48.850 --> 08:50.120
and copy yours grudgingly.

08:51.490 --> 08:52.760
Don't take your undeserved gain for granted.

08:55.730 --> 08:56.520
Xianxian

08:56.880 --> 08:59.200
Please give me your math homework.

09:01.850 --> 09:03.850
You two are definitely deskmates.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.120
Thank you.

09:13.610 --> 09:15.970
The monthly quiz results have come.

09:16.250 --> 09:17.320
The class supervisor also said

09:17.410 --> 09:19.250
he would talk with us

09:19.410 --> 09:20.410
one by one.

09:20.640 --> 09:22.290
Be prepared.

09:25.050 --> 09:26.680
How did it happen?

09:40.170 --> 09:41.440
Yes!

09:46.440 --> 09:47.250
What's wrong?

09:48.410 --> 09:50.290
My score of natural science is 270.

09:50.440 --> 09:51.730
A perfect pass.

09:51.970 --> 09:54.000
I said I would stay here.

10:00.560 --> 10:01.200
By the way

10:01.410 --> 10:02.760
my mom confiscated my phone.

10:02.850 --> 10:04.290
So we can't call at night.

10:05.080 --> 10:06.370
Nobody wants to call you.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.490
You called me.

10:11.120 --> 10:11.760
You.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.000
Don't you remember?

10:14.490 --> 10:15.170
Who?

10:15.290 --> 10:16.120
It's you.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.370
You called me.

10:17.370 --> 10:18.170
Who did you mean?

10:19.610 --> 10:20.290
Don't touch my hair.

10:20.290 --> 10:21.320
-Say it again.  -What are you doing?

10:22.080 --> 10:23.520
Concentrate on self-study.

10:42.080 --> 10:43.850
Why are you so happy? A stroke of luck?

10:45.370 --> 10:47.680
Mom, let me show you something.

10:56.640 --> 10:57.610
So

10:58.250 --> 11:00.200
I can stay in science class, right?

11:00.680 --> 11:02.760
You did well enough in this quiz.

11:03.930 --> 11:04.850
It's nothing to me.

11:05.560 --> 11:08.850
In fact, science is not as difficult as you think.

11:09.810 --> 11:10.850
But, Xianxian.

11:11.370 --> 11:12.880
Although you did well this time

11:13.200 --> 11:14.200
-in fact...  -Stop.

11:14.760 --> 11:16.680
Mom, we came to an agreement.

11:17.290 --> 11:19.290
It's dishonest of you to go back on your word.

11:20.250 --> 11:21.410
All right, all right, all right.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.640
Anyway, you choose your own way.

11:23.880 --> 11:24.930
Go by yourself.

11:25.320 --> 11:27.050
Then you know it's hard.

11:30.610 --> 11:31.730
Well.

11:32.050 --> 11:32.640
Mom.

11:33.560 --> 11:35.850
I have finished the exam.

11:36.410 --> 11:38.640
I want...

11:45.170 --> 11:46.560
I know what you're thinking.

11:46.970 --> 11:47.610
Thank you, mom.

11:50.170 --> 11:51.810
Have fun. Pride comes before a fall.

11:56.640 --> 11:57.810
The monthly quiz this time

11:57.810 --> 11:59.250
is relatively simple.

11:59.810 --> 12:01.810
Although your score has improved greatly

12:02.560 --> 12:04.610
your ranking is still relatively low.

12:05.250 --> 12:07.000
Never take it lightly.

12:07.290 --> 12:08.200
OK, Mr. Liu.

12:10.850 --> 12:11.640
Ding Xian

12:12.080 --> 12:13.250
One more thing.

12:14.050 --> 12:14.810
I saw you chat a lot

12:14.810 --> 12:16.810
in class with Zhou Siyue recently.

12:17.320 --> 12:18.930
Did he affect your study?

12:19.930 --> 12:22.370
No, Mr. Liu. He didn't affect me.

12:22.810 --> 12:24.490
But someone did tell me

12:24.490 --> 12:26.120
you two had been so close lately.

12:26.370 --> 12:28.290
And you often go out together after school.

12:29.290 --> 12:31.930
Ding Xian, there's no time to waste.

12:32.640 --> 12:34.520
Focus on your study now.

12:35.760 --> 12:37.000
This is not the case.

12:37.610 --> 12:40.080
Our relationship is not what you think.

12:41.410 --> 12:43.560
Well, change seats with Song Ziqi

12:43.560 --> 12:44.640
after going back.

12:44.760 --> 12:46.290
I'll study hard when I go back.

12:46.760 --> 12:47.850
We won't chat in class.

12:48.290 --> 12:49.120
Don't worry, Mr. Liu.

12:49.880 --> 12:50.930
If I don't make progress

12:50.930 --> 12:51.970
in the next monthly quiz

12:52.520 --> 12:53.520
I'll change seats

12:53.520 --> 12:54.970
on my own.

12:57.560 --> 12:59.370
Who told Auntie?

12:59.560 --> 13:00.810
So gossipy.

13:00.850 --> 13:02.050
Don't ever let me know.

13:08.250 --> 13:09.560
I guess it must be a girl.

13:09.970 --> 13:12.440
She was jealous of your close relationship.

13:14.490 --> 13:15.610
Watch what you say.

13:15.850 --> 13:17.640
We're merely deskmates.

13:20.200 --> 13:22.200
Maybe we won't be deskmates later.

13:22.850 --> 13:23.490
Why?

13:24.080 --> 13:25.560
Auntie asked me to change seats.

13:25.730 --> 13:27.120
He said it would affect my study.

13:27.680 --> 13:28.610
No way.

13:28.930 --> 13:30.760
Why do all teachers like this?

13:31.490 --> 13:32.370
Not only that

13:32.810 --> 13:34.640
he asked me to change seats with Song Ziqi.

13:35.000 --> 13:36.080
You can't.

13:39.810 --> 13:41.410
Don't you dislike him?

13:42.320 --> 13:44.170
I was just speaking casually. I don't mind.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.680
I smell a rat.

13:51.200 --> 13:52.930
When we went to KTV that day

13:53.200 --> 13:55.490
he was angry when he saw

13:56.050 --> 13:57.610
I was singing with other boys.

13:57.680 --> 13:59.320
He just sat there without a word.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.680
Finally, he took me home.

14:02.290 --> 14:03.610
I suddenly felt

14:03.730 --> 14:05.810
he was a little different that day.

14:07.370 --> 14:08.560
Fickle.

14:09.120 --> 14:10.680
You weren't like this the other day.

14:11.000 --> 14:12.250
You were mad to see him

14:12.250 --> 14:13.000
walking with the girl.

14:13.410 --> 14:14.730
That was a mistake.

14:14.970 --> 14:16.170
He told me later

14:16.440 --> 14:17.970
they just discussed

14:17.970 --> 14:19.410
the basketball game.

14:20.850 --> 14:21.930
How did you know that?

14:26.120 --> 14:28.050
I went to her that day to find it out.

14:30.000 --> 14:30.850
Hello.

14:33.000 --> 14:33.850
What's up?

14:35.290 --> 14:36.640
She is actually a national

14:36.640 --> 14:37.880
second level shot-putter.

14:38.560 --> 14:40.320
She almost killed me.

14:43.640 --> 14:44.730
Stop talking about me.

14:44.930 --> 14:46.680
When do you change seats?

14:49.520 --> 14:50.520
Maybe after the monthly quiz.

14:51.170 --> 14:52.490
It depends on my quiz result.

15:01.810 --> 15:02.410
Ding Xian

15:02.880 --> 15:03.880
Can you solve this problem?

15:04.050 --> 15:05.050
I've been stuck for a long time.

15:05.410 --> 15:06.490
Let me have a look.

15:11.320 --> 15:14.320
The function

15:14.810 --> 15:16.320
of ordinate.

15:18.000 --> 15:18.730
Answer.

15:19.880 --> 15:21.730
R is greater than B.

15:22.410 --> 15:24.050
RX proves...

15:24.290 --> 15:25.120
1025.

15:25.440 --> 15:28.250
X equals 1025.

15:30.250 --> 15:31.080
So accurate.

15:31.640 --> 15:32.440
What about this one?

15:33.810 --> 15:34.730
I'll try again.

15:36.490 --> 15:37.880
547.

15:38.810 --> 15:40.370
Nine o'clock.

15:40.730 --> 15:42.290
547.

15:43.370 --> 15:44.320
You can count in your head?

15:46.490 --> 15:48.490
Don't you feel tired of solving problems all the time?

15:48.560 --> 15:49.930
I mean, rack your brain.

15:50.930 --> 15:51.930
No, I don't.

15:52.490 --> 15:54.290
I'll do reading comprehension for relax

15:54.320 --> 15:55.490
when I feel tired.

15:56.610 --> 15:58.120
You're a real brain box.

15:58.640 --> 16:00.120
Let's go on.

16:00.760 --> 16:02.170
I still couldn't understand this question.

16:04.520 --> 16:06.440
Can you teach me with your method?

16:06.610 --> 16:07.730
Superficial knowledge is enough.

16:07.810 --> 16:08.640
OK.

16:09.520 --> 16:11.000
If you can't solve the problem later

16:11.520 --> 16:12.760
you can ask me directly.

16:12.850 --> 16:13.730
OK, OK.

16:30.250 --> 16:31.050
Zhou Siyue

16:33.440 --> 16:34.320
Let's play basketball.

16:36.490 --> 16:38.930
You called me out so early for this?

16:39.850 --> 16:40.970
Haven't you heard

16:41.120 --> 16:42.490
a saying from my idol?

16:43.170 --> 16:44.120
Have ever seen the scene

16:44.250 --> 16:45.810
of Shenhai at 4 a.m.?

16:46.370 --> 16:47.560
It's six o'clock.

16:48.490 --> 16:49.200
They're the same.

16:49.200 --> 16:51.410
Hardship increases status.

16:51.760 --> 16:53.520
I haven't seen you study so hard.

16:55.250 --> 16:56.610
What's the matter with you lately?

16:56.850 --> 16:58.170
It's just a competition.

16:58.170 --> 16:59.320
Why are you so tired?

16:59.760 --> 17:00.970
Competition is not tiring

17:01.290 --> 17:02.810
but explaining problems is.

17:03.120 --> 17:04.680
You're so strange.

17:04.850 --> 17:06.680
Liu Xiaofeng is not much of your friend.

17:06.850 --> 17:08.130
Why are you explaining problems to him every day?

17:17.890 --> 17:18.920
Nobody else here.

17:19.039 --> 17:19.770
I'm leaving.

17:19.799 --> 17:20.799
They will be here soon.

17:21.370 --> 17:22.160
The game is coming.

17:22.160 --> 17:24.160
Everyone will train against the clock.

17:24.530 --> 17:25.770
I won't take part in the game.

17:26.280 --> 17:27.440
Why should I train?

17:29.400 --> 17:30.890
Don't you want to see

17:30.920 --> 17:32.920
pretty girls cheering for you?

17:36.040 --> 17:37.010
Don't you want to

17:37.040 --> 17:39.200
help me teach Class Eight a lesson?

17:40.320 --> 17:41.320
It's none of my business.

17:43.370 --> 17:45.370
But I signed you up.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.250
Nobody can change it.

17:47.970 --> 17:48.920
Come on.

17:50.200 --> 17:51.160
I'll go back to bed.

17:52.610 --> 17:53.400
Practice hard.

18:00.010 --> 18:00.730
Xianxian

18:01.800 --> 18:03.320
Why didn't you go to the basketball game?

18:03.920 --> 18:05.320
Nothing special.

18:05.320 --> 18:06.490
I'm preparing for the monthly quiz.

18:06.970 --> 18:08.370
Zhou Siyue is also the player.

18:08.370 --> 18:09.530
You don't want to go?

18:09.610 --> 18:11.250
Didn't he refuse to take part in it?

18:11.610 --> 18:12.970
Don't you know Song Ziqi?

18:13.250 --> 18:13.920
He must grab Zhou Siyue

18:13.920 --> 18:15.560
no matter what he does.

18:16.320 --> 18:17.920
Class Eight is too arrogant.

18:18.160 --> 18:19.650
They're showing off because they have

18:19.770 --> 18:20.850
posters and banners.

18:22.040 --> 18:23.280
Why not print one?

18:23.370 --> 18:24.400
We're not afraid of them.

18:24.400 --> 18:26.370
But it's too late to print now.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.490
Do you have any cardboards?

18:29.680 --> 18:30.800
I can draw.

18:32.280 --> 18:33.800
How can I forget you?

18:34.040 --> 18:35.040
I'll bring some paper.

18:36.770 --> 18:37.730
Bring it.

18:37.730 --> 18:38.560
Hurry up. Come on.

18:38.890 --> 18:39.490
Here you are.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.890
You guys, come here.

18:49.280 --> 18:52.010
What's the most in science class?

18:52.560 --> 18:52.920
Right.

18:53.320 --> 18:54.530
Boys.

18:55.040 --> 18:57.200
Today is the time for Class Three to distinguish ourselves.

18:57.610 --> 18:59.130
Just do it.

18:59.650 --> 19:00.650
But they have cheerleaders.

19:01.250 --> 19:02.530
And megaphones.

19:02.680 --> 19:03.970
Come on, Class Eight!

19:04.160 --> 19:06.010
Come on, Class Eight!

19:06.160 --> 19:08.010
Come on, Class Eight!

19:08.200 --> 19:09.890
Come on, Class Eight!

19:09.920 --> 19:10.920
Come on, Class Eight!

19:10.920 --> 19:11.850
So what?

19:12.200 --> 19:13.920
We have Childe Siyue.

19:14.370 --> 19:14.920
Right?

19:18.610 --> 19:20.160
Please do me a favor, bro.

19:20.320 --> 19:22.130
If you don't go, girls won't watch either.

19:22.890 --> 19:25.010
I told you I didn't want to play today.

19:27.850 --> 19:28.680
Suit yourself.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.200
Come here, guys.

19:33.010 --> 19:33.560
Come on.

19:34.320 --> 19:36.280
One two three. Come on.

19:43.770 --> 19:46.440
Ding Xian, you draw very well.

19:47.680 --> 19:48.920
I'm leaving. Thank you.

19:48.920 --> 19:49.770
Thank you. Bye.

19:49.920 --> 19:50.890
Thank you. Bye.

19:54.530 --> 19:55.650
OK. Let's go.

19:57.730 --> 19:58.650
Wait a moment.

19:59.160 --> 19:59.800
Xianxian

20:01.130 --> 20:02.800
Can you draw another one for me?

20:02.800 --> 20:04.970
Write "Song Ziqi is handsome" on it.

20:07.610 --> 20:10.160
Something's wrong with you.

20:10.610 --> 20:12.010
Help me.

20:12.200 --> 20:16.490
OK. Song Ziqi is handsome.

20:18.400 --> 20:19.370
What do you mean?

20:20.610 --> 20:22.680
OK. I'll draw it for you.

20:25.250 --> 20:26.400
Come on!

20:26.970 --> 20:28.530
Come on, Class Eight!

20:28.970 --> 20:30.370
Come on, Class Eight!

20:30.770 --> 20:34.770
Come on, Class Eight! Come on, Class Eight!

20:34.970 --> 20:36.370
Come on, Class Eight!

21:08.490 --> 21:09.680
How did you pass the ball?

21:30.920 --> 21:32.370
Stop dawdling.

21:32.680 --> 21:34.010
The game has already begun.

21:34.800 --> 21:35.850
Don't rush us.

21:36.130 --> 21:38.200
Don't you see we're busy now?

21:40.160 --> 21:40.850
Done.

21:43.530 --> 21:44.850
So good-looking.

21:46.080 --> 21:47.370
Look. Is it good-looking?

21:52.280 --> 21:54.010
This one is for Zhou Siyue.

21:54.160 --> 21:55.280
I prepared it for you.

21:56.320 --> 21:59.130
It's so kind of you.

22:01.530 --> 22:02.800
Well, you win.

22:03.320 --> 22:04.250
Naive.

22:28.650 --> 22:30.920
No, Class Eight is too aggressive.

22:30.920 --> 22:31.850
I can't hold out.

22:34.320 --> 22:36.010
Hurry to enter the court, Childe.

22:36.280 --> 22:37.160
I'm too tired to play.

22:37.560 --> 22:38.200
You.

22:38.970 --> 22:40.080
You've performed below par?

22:42.010 --> 22:42.920
Yang Chunzi

22:42.920 --> 22:44.370
I'm glad that you bring me water.

22:44.440 --> 22:45.850
But you're in Class Eight now.

22:46.040 --> 22:46.680
I'll feel awkward if you do this.

22:46.680 --> 22:48.010
Siyue, drink water.

22:53.850 --> 22:54.560
Thank you.

22:57.010 --> 22:57.850
Put on airs.

22:58.080 --> 22:59.490
Don't you think she's a hypocrite?

22:59.610 --> 23:00.680
She has the same expression

23:00.680 --> 23:01.800
no matter she's happy or not.

23:01.800 --> 23:02.890
Yes indeed.

23:02.890 --> 23:04.490
They're not in the same class now.

23:04.800 --> 23:06.200
Does she specialize in water delivery?

23:09.130 --> 23:10.200
What are you laughing at?

23:10.730 --> 23:12.370
We're on your side.

23:30.040 --> 23:30.770
Who's tired?

23:32.370 --> 23:33.320
I can't make it. I can't make it.

23:33.320 --> 23:34.080
You can have a rest.

23:34.280 --> 23:35.920
Finally you're awake, bro.

23:38.530 --> 23:39.130
Let's go.

23:40.160 --> 23:41.490
Come on. Come on.

23:42.850 --> 23:46.160
Zhou Siyue. Come on. Come on.

23:46.370 --> 23:48.280
Zhou Siyue. Come on. Come on.

23:48.280 --> 23:49.680
Zhou Siyue, you can do it!

23:50.160 --> 23:51.800
Come on, Zhou Siyue.

24:14.530 --> 24:15.970
Come on, Class Three!

24:16.160 --> 24:17.730
Come on, Class Three!

24:18.010 --> 24:19.530
Come on, Class Three!

24:19.770 --> 24:21.530
Come on, Class Three!

24:54.440 --> 24:57.010
Bravo, Zhou Siyue!

24:57.370 --> 24:59.400
Where is your energy of misbehaving?

24:59.650 --> 25:01.800
We can't lose in momentum.

25:01.850 --> 25:02.800
Shout.

25:03.250 --> 25:06.560
Zhou Siyue, you're the best.

25:07.010 --> 25:08.490
Come on, Class Three!

25:08.650 --> 25:10.200
Come on, Class Three!

25:10.400 --> 25:11.970
Come on, Class Three!

25:12.160 --> 25:13.650
Come on, Class Three!

25:13.890 --> 25:15.970
Come on, Class Three!

27:04.560 --> 27:05.440
Zhou is great.

27:30.730 --> 27:32.200
Pretty? Are you blind?

27:33.890 --> 27:35.130
One day has passed.

27:35.370 --> 27:36.730
Why hasn't Siyue come yet?

27:37.650 --> 27:38.890
Did he ask for leave?

27:39.800 --> 27:40.490
We're not

27:40.490 --> 27:42.250
inseparable, right?

27:46.280 --> 27:48.440
I have a piece of good news.

27:49.160 --> 27:51.160
In the math competition of our city

27:51.490 --> 27:53.250
Zhou Siyue

27:53.610 --> 27:54.970
doesn't let us down.

27:55.850 --> 27:57.680
He has won the first place in our city.

28:02.040 --> 28:03.130
Deng Wanwan

28:03.530 --> 28:05.080
Hang the award on the wall.

28:05.730 --> 28:06.800
Zhou Siyue is so brilliant.

28:08.370 --> 28:10.560
Don't be discouraged if you don't

28:10.560 --> 28:11.530
get the ranking this time.

28:12.280 --> 28:14.440
There are many chances in the future.

28:14.730 --> 28:16.010
Look forward.

28:16.610 --> 28:18.130
OK. Stop discussing.

28:18.530 --> 28:19.770
Start your free study class.

28:26.490 --> 28:29.400
Zhou Siyue deserves to be Mr. Liu's son.

28:31.680 --> 28:32.530
What's your meaning?

28:33.560 --> 28:35.530
Let me tell you.

28:35.800 --> 28:37.530
Zhou Siyue was found sneaking out

28:37.530 --> 28:39.250
the night before the competition.

28:39.530 --> 28:41.370
He was still qualified to participate in the competition.

28:42.920 --> 28:45.040
Now he won the first place through the back door.

28:45.250 --> 28:46.320
I can't catch up with him

28:46.370 --> 28:46.970
in this field.

28:47.200 --> 28:48.770
Watch what you say.

28:48.770 --> 28:51.530
He Xingwen, can you be less jealous?

28:51.970 --> 28:53.200
Siyue has won honour in the basketball match

28:53.200 --> 28:54.490
for our class.

28:55.080 --> 28:56.970
He also comes out in front in math.

28:57.370 --> 29:00.040
What? You're jealous, aren't you?

29:01.010 --> 29:01.800
I'm jealous?

29:02.160 --> 29:03.160
Why am I jealous?

29:03.560 --> 29:05.490
I just think it's unfair.

29:05.730 --> 29:07.320
Why is the teacher so partial to him?

29:07.610 --> 29:09.770
I heard Siyue was also punished.

29:09.920 --> 29:12.650
He seemed to have run ten laps in the playground.

29:14.250 --> 29:15.320
Ten laps?

29:15.610 --> 29:17.650
Only ten laps after such a big mistake.

29:17.890 --> 29:19.250
Isn't that obvious favoritism?

29:20.080 --> 29:21.560
If you think it's unfair

29:22.280 --> 29:23.730
you can tell the teacher.

29:24.400 --> 29:26.040
Why do you comment on him behind his back?

29:26.080 --> 29:27.200
That's all what you can do now?

29:27.370 --> 29:28.130
Right.

29:28.610 --> 29:30.770
-Why don't you mention it just now?  -Right.

29:30.970 --> 29:32.490
Why don't you mention it just now?

29:48.080 --> 29:50.320
Zhou Siyue

29:51.680 --> 29:54.010
Zhou Siyue

30:07.080 --> 30:08.200
The light is on.

30:10.200 --> 30:11.370
Zhou Siyue

30:14.850 --> 30:16.320
Zhou Siyue

30:26.850 --> 30:27.920
Zhou Siyue

30:35.080 --> 30:36.010
Zhou Siyue

30:38.610 --> 30:39.400
Who is it?

30:46.730 --> 30:47.730
You have a cold?

30:48.890 --> 30:50.770
I caught cold while playing basketball before.

30:51.920 --> 30:53.200
It's so cold in your house.

30:53.800 --> 30:54.920
You dare to open the window.

30:54.920 --> 30:56.130
Aren't you afraid of getting worse?

31:02.800 --> 31:03.770
It's you?

31:05.280 --> 31:06.730
I didn't mean it.

31:09.680 --> 31:10.890
It can ventilate your room.

31:11.970 --> 31:12.920
It's good.

31:21.200 --> 31:22.610
Where is your mother?

31:22.890 --> 31:23.850
She

31:24.130 --> 31:25.010
went out.

31:26.610 --> 31:28.800
Have you eaten yet?

31:31.010 --> 31:32.160
I just woke up.

31:32.280 --> 31:33.250
I feel lazy.

31:37.400 --> 31:39.080
Is there anything to eat at home?

31:41.280 --> 31:41.890
Instant noodles?

31:43.530 --> 31:44.490
Well.

32:08.770 --> 32:09.440
Is it enough?

32:28.490 --> 32:29.530
Soup?

32:30.010 --> 32:30.970
It's porridge.

32:32.320 --> 32:33.770
I cooked it for the first time.

32:36.680 --> 32:37.800
It looks nice.

32:53.370 --> 32:54.250
How does it taste?

32:55.680 --> 32:56.490
Tasty.

32:57.800 --> 32:59.560
Eat more.

33:04.560 --> 33:05.680
I'll help myself.

33:15.530 --> 33:17.040
I'll repair the window.

33:17.850 --> 33:18.730
No.

33:19.320 --> 33:20.560
It will hurt your hand.

33:22.250 --> 33:23.080
Sit down.

33:33.560 --> 33:35.040
Why did you visit me suddenly?

33:37.200 --> 33:38.920
You have won the first place in the competition.

33:39.250 --> 33:40.680
I want to tell you.

33:41.650 --> 33:42.610
And

33:42.920 --> 33:44.370
Mr. Liu punished you

33:45.680 --> 33:46.890
because you

33:48.370 --> 33:49.920
sneaked out, right?

33:53.200 --> 33:54.530
Who told you?

33:59.250 --> 34:00.250
Sorry.

34:02.730 --> 34:04.040
Not because of you.

34:07.490 --> 34:08.250
Are

34:09.160 --> 34:10.160
you tired?

34:14.359 --> 34:15.250
Yes.

34:16.200 --> 34:17.530
But then what will happen?

34:20.359 --> 34:21.879
I'm afraid you're too tired.

34:22.490 --> 34:23.640
What if

34:23.770 --> 34:25.250
you get depressed one day?

34:28.770 --> 34:29.730
What will

34:30.840 --> 34:32.290
you do if that day comes?

34:34.250 --> 34:36.640
I will help you unconditionally

34:37.330 --> 34:38.810
and stay with you.

34:47.810 --> 34:49.010
Stupid.

34:52.680 --> 34:54.570
I'm not as vulnerable as you think.

34:56.490 --> 34:57.290
And

34:58.050 --> 35:00.440
there must be many more difficulties in the future.

35:01.680 --> 35:03.770
But I won't let you worry.

35:16.770 --> 35:18.840
I'll get you a cup of hot water.

35:38.640 --> 35:39.250
Not bad.

35:39.250 --> 35:40.120
Ding Xian

35:40.770 --> 35:42.050
Where did you put

35:42.050 --> 35:42.920
those dirty clothes?

35:43.010 --> 35:44.050
I'll bring them to you later.

35:59.920 --> 36:00.810
What are you doing?

36:04.120 --> 36:05.090
Your cooking?

36:05.810 --> 36:06.920
It's terrible.

36:07.530 --> 36:10.200
Ding Xian, don't cook anymore.

36:10.600 --> 36:11.970
It's dark cuisine.

36:37.490 --> 36:39.920
You eat my cooking and blame me.

36:40.970 --> 36:42.250
-Ding Xian.  -Come here.

36:52.880 --> 36:55.600
Mom, what are you doing with my diary?

36:55.970 --> 36:57.010
Ding Xian

36:58.120 --> 36:59.440
How old are you?

37:00.120 --> 37:01.970
You didn't put your mind on your study.

37:02.200 --> 37:04.400
What are you thinking about?

37:06.090 --> 37:07.400
You read my diary?

37:07.570 --> 37:08.400
I won't know

37:08.400 --> 37:10.400
what you have done if I don't read it.

37:15.770 --> 37:17.810
I lost to him in the game room.

37:18.400 --> 37:19.640
Mom, stop reading.

37:20.290 --> 37:21.490
Isn't that what you write?

37:22.050 --> 37:23.360
Why are you afraid to hear that?

37:26.290 --> 37:27.050
Give me.

37:27.970 --> 37:28.920
Give me your diary.

37:30.360 --> 37:31.970
This doesn't end if you don't give me.

37:31.970 --> 37:32.770
Give me.

37:32.770 --> 37:33.970
What are you doing? Give me.

37:38.530 --> 37:39.680
Are you satisfied?

37:41.010 --> 37:42.490
I won't keep a diary anymore.

37:44.050 --> 37:45.400
Suit yourself.

37:46.250 --> 37:47.440
I tell you.

37:47.920 --> 37:49.680
You're not allowed to go out from now on.

38:15.400 --> 38:16.360
What are you doing?

38:16.920 --> 38:18.360
I quarreled with my mother.

38:19.010 --> 38:20.730
I threw out my diary.

38:23.640 --> 38:25.050
Are you sure you threw it here?

38:37.640 --> 38:38.970
I just saw a rag man pass by

38:38.970 --> 38:40.090
on the other side.

38:46.400 --> 38:49.250
Excuse me. Did you see a rag man?

38:49.360 --> 38:50.640
He left early.

38:52.090 --> 38:52.970
He left.

39:06.600 --> 39:07.570
Don't cry.

39:15.120 --> 39:16.120
I'm fine.

39:21.770 --> 39:23.570
Let it go.

39:36.120 --> 39:37.600
If you don't want to go home

39:39.730 --> 39:41.010
stay in my house for a while.

39:46.840 --> 39:47.570
Let's go.

40:19.440 --> 40:20.440
Are you hungry?

40:21.050 --> 40:22.200
You didn't have breakfast?

40:23.010 --> 40:24.570
I cooked porridge and

40:24.970 --> 40:26.810
wanted to bring it to you.

40:28.920 --> 40:31.400
But I ran out in a fit of pique and couldn't get it back.

40:32.600 --> 40:33.400
And

40:34.120 --> 40:35.920
the porridge is terrible.

40:36.570 --> 40:38.490
You're kidding me.

40:42.730 --> 40:44.440
Maybe it's because I'm sick

40:44.730 --> 40:45.840
so my taste sense doesn't work.

40:49.160 --> 40:51.120
It seems that there is nothing to eat at home.

40:54.730 --> 40:56.640
Only instant noodles.

40:57.490 --> 40:58.330
Come on.

40:59.120 --> 41:01.400
Seafood or braised beef flavor?

41:02.200 --> 41:03.090
Either.

41:03.600 --> 41:04.400
OK.

41:05.570 --> 41:06.840
I'll boil the kettle.

41:13.330 --> 41:14.730
It's done.

41:28.290 --> 41:30.730
It's my first time to eat instant noodles.

41:30.970 --> 41:32.770
Usually mom doesn't let me eat.

41:34.730 --> 41:35.680
Your mother

41:37.160 --> 41:38.600
treats you well.

41:40.970 --> 41:41.920
Perhaps.

41:44.770 --> 41:46.640
But she doesn't understand

41:47.730 --> 41:48.970
or believe me.

41:51.290 --> 41:52.360
She peeked at

41:54.600 --> 41:56.400
my diary this time.

42:00.160 --> 42:01.090
Your mother

42:02.490 --> 42:03.680
did that because she

42:03.680 --> 42:05.090
cared about you.

42:08.200 --> 42:09.640
Your mother treats you really well.

42:16.440 --> 42:17.250
By the way.

42:17.770 --> 42:18.970
Let me show you something.

42:34.570 --> 42:35.640
What's this?

42:36.120 --> 42:37.840
My awarded work

42:37.970 --> 42:39.050
in the robot competition.

42:41.050 --> 42:43.570
Come on, D2-T3. Dance.

42:54.090 --> 42:55.730
It's cute.

42:57.730 --> 43:00.050
Why does it dance like Chaplin?

43:00.330 --> 43:01.810
You know Chaplin?

43:02.440 --> 43:03.330
Good.

43:06.160 --> 43:06.920
How do you feel?

43:07.530 --> 43:10.010
Feel better now?

43:11.200 --> 43:12.090
Much better.

43:13.730 --> 43:14.970
It's interesting.

43:15.970 --> 43:17.920
A successful test.

43:18.810 --> 43:19.640
Test?

43:21.440 --> 43:22.330
It

43:22.770 --> 43:25.770
is actually a comedian robot.

43:26.600 --> 43:27.840
It specializes in treating

43:28.640 --> 43:30.880
patients with mental diseases.

43:35.600 --> 43:37.440
You're with mental disease.

43:38.640 --> 43:39.730
Well. Hurry up.

43:40.010 --> 43:41.200
I'll take you home after finishing it.

43:43.440 --> 43:44.810
I don't want to go back yet.

43:47.010 --> 43:48.810
Can I stay here for one night?
